    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In V-Monsters Digital Farm, the focus is all about taking care of your virtual monsters and decorating your farm your way. No complicated storylines\u2014just a relaxed, creative experience perfect for fans of simulation games and virtual pets.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Raise and Evolve V-Monsters</strong><br>Feed, play, and train your monsters so they stay healthy and reach their full potential.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decorate Your Farm</strong><br>Build the ideal space for your V-Monsters. Customize every corner with items, furniture, and unique themes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stress-Free Management</strong><br>Take care of your monsters\u2019 needs and your farm without the pressure of complex quests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fun Interactions</strong><br>Offer different types of food, play mini-games, and boost their happiness!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Join the Community!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to share your farm with other players or exchange tips on caring for your V-Monsters?<br>Come join our official Discord!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In V-Monsters Digital Farm, the focus is all about taking care of your virtual monsters and decorating your farm your way. No complicated storylines\u2014just a relaxed, creative experience perfect for fans of simulation games and virtual pets.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Raise and Evolve V-Monsters</strong><br>Feed, play, and train your monsters so they stay healthy and reach their full potential.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decorate Your Farm</strong><br>Build the ideal space for your V-Monsters. Customize every corner with items, furniture, and unique themes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stress-Free Management</strong><br>Take care of your monsters\u2019 needs and your farm without the pressure of complex quests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fun Interactions</strong><br>Offer different types of food, play mini-games, and boost their happiness!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Join the Community!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to share your farm with other players or exchange tips on caring for your V-Monsters?<br>Come join our official Discord!</p>",
